<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<style>

body{
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    margin:35px;
    color:#222;
}

.header{
    text-align:center;
}

.logo{
    width:180px;
}

.title{
    font-size:32px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#4400B2;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.subtitle{
    font-size:12px;
    color:#666;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.box{
    border:2px solid #4400B2;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:15px;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.section{
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#4400B2;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
}

th{
    background:#4400B2;
    color:white;
    padding:10px;
}

td{
    border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;
    padding:8px;
}

.total{
    text-align:right;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#4400B2;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-top:15px;
}

.footer{
    margin-top:60px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:12px;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="header">

<img src="/images/logo-itcc.png" class="logo">

<div class="title">
HISTORIAL DE PAGOS
</div>

<div class="subtitle">
Este documento refleja el historial de pagos y estado del paquete contratado.
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
